# Low Water, Act 1: the encounters and their talk exits (Act 1 only; tools and foes are in combat.lwd).
# Director's file. System: design/SYSTEMS-FULL.md section 18; four ways through: NOTES-FOR-ENGINEER.

# Low Water, Act 1: the Fray. Opponents, tools and encounters. Director's file.
# System: design/SYSTEMS-FULL.md section 18. The combat engineer (game/engine/combat/) owns the
# tuning numbers; the numbers here are the director's first guess, in the same units as Lamb's
# (Standing 6 + 2 x COAT, Breath 4 + KNEES). Encounters hand back to the district's nodes:
#   <district>.fight.<name>.win / .yield / .fled / .down
# Start one with: do: fight(e.<name>)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- encounters (SYSTEMS-FULL 18.11)
@encounter e.salvors
name: Copper on the floor
area: floor
foe: f.lugg 1
foe: f.salvor 2
prop: snare 12 7 ? has(floor.handline)
talk: fx.salvors.parley | Put the sack down ? (fight_struck >= 1 | fight_seconds >= 10) & fight_lamb_standing >= 4
win: floor.fight.salvors.win
yield: floor.fight.salvors.yield
fled: floor.fight.salvors.fled
down: floor.fight.salvors.down
param: tide-ends-fight

@encounter e.conger
name: The thing in the hole
area: floor
foe: f.conger 1
win: floor.fight.conger.win
yield: floor.fight.conger.yield
fled: floor.fight.conger.fled
down: floor.fight.conger.down

@encounter e.gulls
name: Gulls at the fish
area: floor
foe: f.gulls 3
talk: fx.gulls.children | Wave the children in with their lanterns ? fight_seconds >= 15
win: floor.fight.gulls.win
yield: floor.fight.gulls.yield
fled: floor.fight.gulls.fled
down: floor.fight.gulls.down

@encounter e.eels
name: Eels in the gully
area: floor
foe: f.eel 3
win: floor.fight.eels.win
yield: floor.fight.eels.yield
fled: floor.fight.eels.fled
down: floor.fight.eels.down

@encounter e.afterdark
name: The after-vote in the dark
area: weigh
light: blackout
opening: alerted
prop: cut 7 1
foe: f.panbearer 1
foe: f.gutter 2
talk: fx.afterdark.nose | Name the switch yourself, aloud ? fight_seconds >= 15 & (has(scales.switch) | has(scales.kept) | has(lamps.pink))
win: weigh.fight.afterdark.win
yield: weigh.fight.afterdark.yield
fled: weigh.fight.afterdark.fled
down: weigh.fight.afterdark.down

@encounter e.lamplighters
name: Two poles
area: quay
foe: f.fewell 1
foe: f.strand 1
prop: cut 3.5 2 ? power.quay == off
prop: cut 10.5 2 ? power.quay == off
prop: cut 17.5 2 ? power.quay == off
talk: fx.lamplighters.quiet | Go quietly ? fight_lamb_standing <= 4
talk: fx.lamplighters.warrant | Show the Shelf's warrant ? fight_struck == 0 & fight_seconds >= 5
win: quay.fight.lamplighters.win
yield: quay.fight.lamplighters.yield
fled: quay.fight.lamplighters.fled
down: quay.fight.lamplighters.down

@encounter e.wardens
name: The Board's tide-wardens
area: quay
foe: f.warden 2
talk: fx.wardens.crake | Say the Alderman's name ? has(met.crake) & fight_seconds >= 5
win: quay.fight.wardens.win
yield: quay.fight.wardens.yield
fled: quay.fight.wardens.fled
down: quay.fight.wardens.down

@encounter e.brawl
name: The Wet Hour
area: brine
param: brawl (everyone fights everyone; Lamb may join, stop it, or keep out of it)
talk: fx.brawl.fork | Catch Sabine's eye ? fight_seconds >= 10
win: brine.fight.brawl.win
yield: brine.fight.brawl.yield
fled: brine.fight.brawl.fled
down: brine.fight.brawl.down

@encounter e.dogs
name: The middens
area: gut
foe: f.dog 3
talk: fx.dogs.egg | Throw them the egg ? count(i.egg) > 0
win: gut.fight.dogs.win
yield: gut.fight.dogs.yield
fled: gut.fight.dogs.fled
down: gut.fight.dogs.down

@encounter e.hammer
name: Keel and the hammer
area: lamp
foe: f.keel 1
param: frost-floor
param: lens-behind (a missed heavy can strike the lens)
talk: fx.hammer.green | Only the green rings, then ? fight_seconds >= 8 & has(lens.green)
talk: fx.hammer.sit | Sit down, harbourmaster ? fight_struck >= 1 & fight_foes_yielding == 0
win: mole.fight.hammer.win
yield: mole.fight.hammer.yield
fled: mole.fight.hammer.fled
down: mole.fight.hammer.down

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- sneak openings (a Shadow route that ends in a fight)
@encounter e.salvors.sneak
name: Copper on the floor, from behind
area: floor
opening: sneak
foe: f.lugg 1
foe: f.salvor 2
prop: snare 12 7 ? has(floor.handline)
talk: fx.salvors.parley | Put the sack down ? (fight_struck >= 1 | fight_seconds >= 10) & fight_lamb_standing >= 4
param: tide-ends-fight
win: floor.fight.salvors.win
yield: floor.fight.salvors.yield
fled: floor.fight.salvors.fled
down: floor.fight.salvors.down

@encounter e.hammer.sneak
name: Keel and the hammer, from the gallery
area: lamp
opening: sneak
foe: f.keel 1
param: frost-floor
param: lens-behind (a missed heavy can strike the lens)
talk: fx.hammer.green | Only the green rings, then ? fight_seconds >= 8 & has(lens.green)
talk: fx.hammer.sit | Sit down, harbourmaster ? fight_struck >= 1 & fight_foes_yielding == 0
win: mole.fight.hammer.win
yield: mole.fight.hammer.yield
fled: mole.fight.hammer.fled
down: mole.fight.hammer.down

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- talk exits: short scenes that end a fight in words
@node fx.salvors.parley
place: drowned
cost: 2
line: LAMB: Put it down. All of you. The water's coming.
nar: Lugg looks at the sack, and at Merrow, and at the tide, which has got into the hole in the tower and is talking to itself in there.
line: MERROW: Sea's had enough of this. So have I.
go: floor.fight.salvors.yield

@node fx.gulls.children
place: fish
cost: 1
nar: The assessor waves both arms. Dilly's children come running with their lanterns held high, shrieking, a dozen small suns, and the gulls lift off the fish all at once like a lid.
go: floor.fight.gulls.win

@node fx.afterdark.nose
place: weigh_in
cost: 2
line: LAMB: Twenty-two minutes to ten. The switch, and back at eight minutes to. There are scales on the handle. I didn't need to smell them.
nar: The knives stop. In the dark somebody laughs, once, the way people laugh at a card trick.
line: MARROW: A nose. Let it be.
go: weigh.fight.afterdark.yield

@node fx.lamplighters.quiet
place: quay
cost: 1
nar: The assessor lowers the case and holds out both wrists, which is the Shelf's posture for this, though it has never before been required.
go: quay.fight.lamplighters.down

@node fx.lamplighters.warrant
place: quay
cost: 2
nar: The assessor produces the Shelf's warrant of inspection, folded small, and holds it to the sodium. Under that light it is the colour of everything else, but it has a seal.
line: STRAND: Is that real? Is it? Would the Sergeant want us to find out?
go: quay.fight.lamplighters.yield

@node fx.wardens.crake
place: quay
cost: 2
line: LAMB: The Alderman will want to know who laid hands on the Shelf.
nar: The name goes into the wardens like cold into a tooth. They look at each other, and at the harbour office window, where the telephone is.
go: quay.fight.wardens.yield

@node fx.brawl.fork
place: brine
cost: 1
nar: Sabine catches the assessor's eye across the room and lifts the pickling fork from behind her ear. She raps it twice on the pump. The Brine stops, mid-swing, like a clock someone has put a finger in.
go: brine.fight.brawl.yield

@node fx.dogs.egg
place: gut
cost: 1
do: take(i.egg)
nar: The egg goes into the middens. Three dogs go after it, and for a while the Gut is a quarrel about an egg, which is a quarrel the dogs understand.
go: gut.fight.dogs.yield

@node fx.hammer.green
place: lamproom
cost: 1
line: LAMB: The green ones. Only the green ones. Leave her the rest.
nar: The hammer stops at the top of its swing.
go: mole.sq.green

@node fx.hammer.sit
place: lamproom
cost: 1
line: LAMB: Sit down, harbourmaster.
nar: He sits, on the ice, in his own water, as if he has been waiting eleven years for somebody to say it.
go: mole.fight.hammer.yield
